    "title": "Reverse First K Nodes of Linked List",
    "category": "Linked List",
    "difficulty": "Medium",
    "problemStatement": "Given the head of a singly linked list and an integer k, reverse only the first k nodes of the list. The remaining nodes must remain unchanged. If k is greater than the length of the list, reverse the entire list. Return the head of the modified linked list.",
    "input": "Integer n Linked list Integer k",
    "output": "The modified linked list.",
    "constraints": "1 <= n <= 10^5 1 <= k <= 10^5"
